{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Oil of Garlic is a ",["l","打造","drinkable crafted item"],". The recipe is earned at ",["l","战斗","Combat"]," skill level 6. The ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"]," also sells Oil of Garlic for 3,000g each."]],["p",["Drinking Oil of Garlic gives the ",["l","效果","Oil of Garlic Buff"]," which lasts for 10 minutes (real-time). The Oil of Garlic Buff prevents enemies from spawning in ",["l","矿井","The Mines"],", except on ",["l","矿井","Dungeon Floors"],". In ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],", it prevents floors from being ",["l","矿井","infested"],", which does not include ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Prehistoric Floors"],", and also prevents ",["l","矿井","swarms"]," of monsters on any level. The Buff has no effect in ",["l","矿井","Dangerous Mines"]," or ",["l","任务","Dangerous Skull Cavern"],"."]],["p",["It is a special-effect buff, meaning that drinking Oil of Garlic will not remove any buffs from other drinks, or vice-versa."]],["p",["Note: this recipe is profitable - it will always result in profit when using the lowest quality ingredients."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Oil of Garlic can be used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," to create the dyeable ",["l","裁缝","Dark Highlight Shirt"],". It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as a green dye at the dye pots, located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["p",["Oil of Garlic is not used in any ",["l","任务","quests"],"."]]]]]}